# Frontend Rules

## Project
NDC (Nairobi DevOps Community) website — React 19, TypeScript 6, Vite 8, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui, Wouter, TanStack Query 5.

## Conventions
- Pages in `client/src/pages/`, components in `client/src/components/`, UI primitives in `components/ui/`
- Use `@/` alias for `client/src/`, `@shared/` for `shared/`
- Import order: builtin → external → internal → parent → sibling → index (ESLint-enforced)
- Use Wouter for routing, not React Router
- Use TanStack React Query for server state, not fetch/axios directly
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional Tailwind classes
- Support dark mode via ThemeContext: `dark:` Tailwind prefix
- No inline styles — Tailwind classes only
- Path alias `@/` maps to `client/src/`

## Hardened Build
- Production drops all console/debugger at esbuild AND terser levels
- No sourcemaps in production builds
- `npm run build:prod` for hardened build, `npm run build` for standard
